1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,595
Hello, everyone.

2
00:00:01,175 --> 00:00:05,195
I have been invited to your organization to advise you about increasing your sales.

3
00:00:05,825 --> 00:00:11,395
I have observed your operations with a great deal of care, and I must say that I have enjoyed my time here.

4
00:00:11,995 --> 00:00:16,995
I should also say that I've been impressed with the dedication and enthusiasm I've seen here.

5
00:00:17,535 --> 00:00:21,255
Your organization provides a valuable service and performs very well.

6
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,195
And the staff is effective and efficient and clearly likes working here.

7
00:00:26,515 --> 00:00:29,415
It is possible, however, to improve your service and your sales.

8
00:00:30,095 --> 00:00:34,755
One of the ways we are going to start doing that is by encouraging staff participation and creativity.

9
00:00:36,455 --> 00:00:40,445
So let's break into small groups and think about ways that we can improve the store.
